From: tompta1 <546706+tompta1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 11:39:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] regulator: apple-pmic-touch: support the August analog LDO

The J120 touch analog rail uses control register 0x312, bit 0. Select the register through compatible match data and preserve unrelated PMIC bits.

[Orchard: from OrchardLinux/orchard#205 (tompta1, 09038adf),
 kernel/patches/drivers/regulator/0012-regulator-apple-pmic-touch-support-the-August-analog.patch; rebased onto main, otherwise unchanged.]

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../regulator/apple-pmic-touch-regulator.c    | 22 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 22 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/regulator/apple-pmic-touch-regulator.c b/drivers/regulator/apple-pmic-touch-regulator.c
index 1bc7f79c1..c1ed755a8 100644
--- a/drivers/regulator/apple-pmic-touch-regulator.c
+++ b/drivers/regulator/apple-pmic-touch-regulator.c
@@ -64,6 +64,24 @@ static const struct regulator_desc apple_d2089_touch_core = {
 	.disable_val = 0,
 };
 
+/*
+ * August (D2400, J120) pmuL(0x30c) encodes LDO index 12 and options 3,
+ * not a register address. In iPadOS 17.7.11 (21H461), _setLDO at
+ * 0xfffffff0064bd8b0 indexes 12-byte entries at 0xfffffff005551a54.
+ * Entry 12 selects control register 0x312 and enable mask 0x01; the
+ * native read/modify/write at 0xfffffff0064bdaac preserves the other bits.
+ */
+static const struct regulator_desc apple_august_touch_analog = {
+	.name = "august-touch-analog",
+	.ops = &apple_pmic_touch_regulator_ops,
+	.type = REGULATOR_VOLTAGE,
+	.owner = THIS_MODULE,
+	.enable_reg = 0x312,
+	.enable_mask = 0x01,
+	.enable_val = 0x01,
+	.disable_val = 0,
+};
+
 static const struct regulator_desc apple_d2186_touch_core = {
 	.name = "d2186-touch-core",
 	.ops = &apple_pmic_touch_regulator_ops,
@@ -248,6 +266,10 @@ static const struct of_device_id apple_pmic_touch_regulator_of_match[] = {
 		.compatible = "apple,d2089-touch-core-regulator",
 		.data = &apple_d2089_touch_core,
 	},
+	{
+		.compatible = "apple,august-touch-analog-regulator",
+		.data = &apple_august_touch_analog,
+	},
 	{
 		.compatible = "apple,d2186-touch-core-regulator",
 		.data = &apple_d2186_touch_core,
